        var steps = '**When you’re somewhere safe:**\n- **Report it to DPS** (non-emergency **213-740-6000**, 24/7). Keep screenshots of any texts, messages or posts, and note what was said and when.\n- **Campus Support & Intervention (213-740-0411)** can help with safety planning and next steps, and USC’s Threat Assessment office takes threat reports (**threatassess@usc.edu**).' + (exP ? '\n- **If it’s a partner or an ex:** a confidential **CARE-SC advocate** is available 24/7 at **213-740-9355 (WELL)** to talk through your options, without you having to make a report.' : '') + '\n- **Talking to someone helps:** USC Counseling and Mental Health is available 24/7 at **213-740-9355**.';
