      if (/\b(grop\w*|sexual(ly)? (assault\w*|harass\w*)|raped|rape|stalk\w*|forced (himself|herself|themselves) on me|pressur\w* me (into|to have) sex|made a pass at me|dating violence|domestic violence|(boyfriend|girlfriend|partner|ex) (hit|hits|beat|beats|choked|threatens|threatened))\b/.test(t)) return true;
